    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109637" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποψοφέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make a slight noise,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τοῖσι ποτοῖσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Coac.</u>
					62
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Epid.</u>
				5.63
			</span></i>; of water under ice, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				6.24
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπορχουμένην ἑαυτῇ . . καὶ τοῖς
				δακτύλοις . . ὑποψοφοῦσαν</span>
			<i>snapping</i> her fingers <i>in accompaniment,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.336c
			</span></i>.</div>
